{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["And the sense of <b>your flocks and your herds shall be set aside</b> is that they were men of livestock, and all their property and wealth was in livestock, and Pharaoh reckoned that they would not leave behind all their wealth and flee. And if perhaps they would do so, behold, great wealth would remain to him, for the livestock was very substantial."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:05:29.735431415Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}